## Writing rules for api/

These rules hold for the files in api/, beside the project's rules in the root AGENTS.md. Where the two differ, follow this file. kapi writes this section from the project's context, so edit outside it.

Keep as it is:
- "Workspace" is correct here; do not rename it to "Space". That rename holds only in changelog/ and help/.
- "Workspace admin" is correct here; do not rename it to "Space Admin". That rename holds only in changelog/ and help/.

Before you finish, run `kapi check <file>` on each file you changed and fix what it reports. `kapi context api/<file>` gives the full answer for one file when you need more than this section.
